  s0: Not recording | gate off in the page
  s1: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way)
  s2: Recording | gate ON in the page
  s3: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s4: Recording, Playwright is picking | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s5: Recording, Playwright is picking | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, 'before' taken#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s6: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: picked for an assertion#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s7: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: swallowed by Playwright's picker after being held#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s8: Recording, Playwright is picking | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: picked for an assertion#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s9: Recording, Playwright is picking | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: picked for an assertion#59; report in#59; in the timeline (before 1, after 1)
  s10: Recording, Playwright is picking | gate ON in the page | click 1: held back, 'before' taken#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: picked for an assertion#59; report in#59; in the timeline (before 1, after 1)
  s11: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: swallowed by Playwright's picker after being held#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline | click 2: picked for an assertion#59; report in#59; in the timeline (before 1, after 1)
  s12: Recording | gate ON in the page | click 1: swallowed by Playwright's picker after being held#59; report in#59; in the timeline (before 2, after 2) | click 2: picked for an assertion#59; report in#59; in the timeline (before 1, after 1)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you press Record
  s1 --> s2: the page switches the gate on
  s2 --> s3: you click (click 1): the gate holds it back
  s3 --> s4: you press Assert visibility
  s4 --> s5: the recorder takes the 'before' of click 1
  s4 --> s6: you click (click 2): Playwright's picker swallows it
  s5 --> s7: the recorder passes click 1 on: Playwright's picker swallows it
  s6 --> s8: you press Assert visibility
  s8 --> s9: Playwright's report for 2 arrives: added to the timeline
  s9 --> s10: the recorder takes the 'before' of click 1
  s10 --> s11: the recorder passes click 1 on: Playwright's picker swallows it
  s11 --> s12: Playwright's report for 1 arrives: added to the timeline
